                 "dashboards render live per request (ARCH-182), so team.convivy.com "
                 "serves whatever branch it sits on",
        "adr": "ARCH-182",
        "jobs": (),
    },
    # The four below came out of PR #347's review. The reviewer found
    # convivy-services; sweeping every launchd plist for the same shape found the
    # other three, which is the fourth time in two days that a list of "the places
    # X happens" was short. The audit below is the answer to that pattern.
    "convivy-services": {
        "reads": "com.convivy.think-gateway is a PERSISTENT service (KeepAlive) "
