    "library": {
        "reads": "com.convivy.library runs the Library API straight out of this "
                 "checkout (platform/decisions/0022 made it its own deployable "
                 "service), so the branch it sits on is the code every request is "
                 "served from — this is the checkout that served code from 19 "
